                note: "2025 taxable-income thresholds at which the 15% and 20% rates begin (IRS Rev. Proc. 2024-40); long gains and qualified dividends stack on top of ordinary income. A trust's or an estate's are compressed: 15% from $3,250 and 20% from $15,900 (2025 Instructions for Form 1041)."
